OL,3,GNEWSAHospital bosses criticised for
OL,4,Aworkplace culture
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospital staff have raised "concerns
OL,7,Faround alleged discrimination in
OL,8,Fleadership and recruitment" during an
OL,9,Finspection of their NHS trust, a
OL,10,Fregulator says.
OL,12,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC) rated
OL,13,Fleadership at Epsom and St Helier
OL,14,FUniversity Hospitals NHS Trust as
OL,15,F"requires improvement" after an
OL,16,Finspection in May.
OL,18,FStaff told inspectors during the
OL,19,Fassessment of "poor cultural practices"
OL,20,Fat the trust and that "managers were
OL,21,Fslow to take actions", according to the
OL,22,FCQC report.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
